ce, workload domain), not placement &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; dashed grey box: out of scope, not deployed &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; dashed arrow: management, lifecycle or identity &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; VCF SSO: both vCenters, both NSX Managers and VCF Operations log in through the Identity Broker &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; VVD stencils &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; blue: fleet &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; teal: m01 &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; purple: w01 &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; amber: NSX &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; light blue: Kubernetes" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F1534;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1185" width="1620" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="HLD103" value="fleet lifecycle" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#0D09B5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F1534;fontFamily=Arial;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="HLD23" target="HLD38"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="HLD104" value="OIDC federation (VCF SSO)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#0D09B5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F1534;fontFamily=Arial;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="HLD11" target="HLD25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="HLD105" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#C98A00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F1534;fontFamily=Arial;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=classic;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="HLD74" target="HLD72"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="HLD106" value="manages" style="edgeStyle=ort